# Use case: replace a serial cable with Bluetooth LE to a phone.
#
# The module offers the Nordic UART service for 120 s. Text typed in the phone app is printed
# here; this is how a product sends logs or takes settings from a phone without a cable.
#
# You need: a NORA-W36 or NORA-B26 EVK and a phone with nRF Connect or a
# "Serial Bluetooth Terminal" app.
#   .\ucxapp --script examples/use-cases/phone-serial-link.ucx
# On the phone: connect to the module, pick the Nordic UART service and send some text.
dev.caps
expect Bluetooth LE:\s+yes
gatt.server.nus 120
